  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e50ec0553be94c648b5fd43a6c41b2fd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Blacksmith_SwordUpgraded
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Blacksmith
  lines:
  - By the forge fires! You actually collected all 20 pieces — impressive dedication.
  - "*hammers sword on anvil*"
  - There! I've reforged your blade with iron-hardened steel. It hits harder now.
  - One more thing — word is a powerful boss lurks beyond these lands to the north.
  - A blade like yours... you might actually have a chance. Go find it when you're ready.
  startsQuest: {fileID: 0}
  inProgressLines: []
  completedLines:
  - Your blade is ready. The boss waits to the north — go when you feel strong enough.
